---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Layout title="Website policies | Mirik Municipality">
  <PageHead slug="policies" title="Website policies" lead="How this website handles your details, what it promises and who made it." />
  <section id="policies">
    <div class="wrap policies">
      <div class="policy" id="privacy"><h2>Privacy</h2><p>This website has no advertising and no tracking. The grievance form asks for your name, phone number, ward and location so the office can act on your complaint. Those details go only to the Municipality Office, by email or through the form service the office sets up. The language you pick is saved in your own browser. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts.</p></div>
      <div class="policy" id="terms-of-use"><h2>Terms of use</h2><p>The information on this site is for general guidance. Rules, fees and dates can change, so check with the Municipality Office before you act on anything. Links to other websites are there for convenience, and the municipality is not responsible for what they contain.</p></div>
      <div class="policy" id="accessibility"><h2>Accessibility</h2><p>We want everyone to be able to use this site. The pages work on phones, can be used with a keyboard, and are available in English, Nepali and Bengali. If something does not work for you, write to the office and we will fix it.</p></div>
      <div class="policy" id="copyright-and-credits"><h2>Copyright and credits</h2><p>Text and pictures on this site belong to Mirik Municipality unless stated otherwise. The site was designed and developed by Studio 1947.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
